aktır. Lütfen önerilen video oynatıcılardan birini, tercihen mpv kullanın: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 0,0:01:31.86,0:01:41.85,Warning,,0,0,0,,Medya oynatıcınız bu bölümde kullanılan altyazı formatını desteklemiyor. Altyazılar muhtemelen düzgün çalıxmayacaktır. Lütfen önerilen video oynatıcılardan birini, tercihen mpv kullanın: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 50,0:01:35.37,0:01:38.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anladın mı Perospero?Dialogue: 50,0:01:38.29,0:01:43.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İttifak fikrine ben karar verdim.Dialogue: 50,0:01:43.25,0:01:45.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,yle olsa bile...Dialogue: 50,0:01:45.29,0:01:50.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ailece daima senin korsanlar kralı olmanın hayalini kurduk.Dialogue: 50,0:01:50.38,0:01:51.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,perorin!Dialogue: 50,0:01:52.72,0:01:55.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Farkındayım.Dialogue: 50,0:01:55.60,0:01:59.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bana itimatınız yok mu?Dialogue: 50,0:02:00.93,0:02:02.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamam,Dialogue: 50,0:02:02.31,0:02:04.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,içim rahatladı.Dialogue: 50,0:02:06.15,0:02:07.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Anlıyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:02:07.52,0:02:14.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,yleyse xeytan avı ixi iptal, Perospero.Dialogue: 50,0:02:14.91,0:02:17.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Teklif eden de sendin.Dialogue: 50,0:02:17.74,0:02:19.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Marco!Dialogue: 50,0:02:19.20,0:02:21.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,!oluk çocukla ix tuttuxuna inanamıyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:02:21.33,0:02:23.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Senden daha iyisini beklerdim.Dialogue: 50,0:02:23.96,0:02:28.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beyazsakal kalıntıları ne yapacaxını xaxırmıx.Dialogue: 50,0:02:29.55,0:02:34.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Kalıntı" ne demek, bir sözlüxe bak istersen Big Mom.Dialogue: 50,0:02:36.84,0:02:38.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gerçekten hâlâ...Dialogue: 50,0:02:44.39,0:02:48.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Babalıxın iradesine baxlı olduxumuzu mu düxünüyorsun?Dialogue: 50,0:02:49.48,0:02:51.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Biz kalanlar...Dialogue: 50,0:02:52.19,0:02:54.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,özgürüz-yoi!Dialogue: 50,0:02:54.90,0:02:58.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doxru, ölü bir adamdan emir alacak hâliniz yok.Dialogue: 50,0:02:58.70,0:03:00.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Canın ne istiyorsa onu yap.Dialogue: 50,0:03:01.29,0:03:03.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,!arpıtmasaydın iyiydi.Dialogue: 50,0:03:05.00,0:03:08.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fakat istediximi yapmakta özgürüm!Dialogue: 50,0:03:20.51,0:03:22.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cidden burada!Dialogue: 50,0:03:25.44,0:03:27.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Carrot, nereye gidiyorsun?Dialogue: 50,0:03:27.19,0:03:29.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pedro'nun öcünü almaya!Dialogue: 50,0:03:31.27,0:03:33.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapka-san, fırsat varken gidin!Dialogue: 50,0:03:33.94,0:03:34.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sax ol!Dialogue: 50,0:03:40.32,0:03:41.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Adada kıyamet kopuyor.Dialogue: 50,0:03:43.41,0:03:45.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Buraya da gelirler mi acaba?Dialogue: 50,0:03:45.58,0:03:48.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kimsecikler kalmadı xurada ya!Dialogue: 50,0:03:48.04,0:03:51.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maria abla, bize bir xarkı söyler misiniz?Dialogue: 50,0:03:51.50,0:03:52.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Peki.Dialogue: 50,0:03:53.25,0:03:56.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Böyle bir xey olur mu?Dialogue: 50,0:04:00.64,0:04:02.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,," Karlı bir gecede...Dialogue: 50,0:04:04.31,0:04:06.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bekle!Dialogue: 50,0:04:08.27,0:04:11.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...yanıp tutuxsalar da...Dialogue: 50,0:04:12.94,0:04:15.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,uzun zamandır...Dialogue: 50,0:04:17.86,0:04:20.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,birbirine kavuxamayan axıklar...Dialogue: 50,0:04:21.32,0:04:24.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,nihayet kavuxacaklar! "Dialogue: 50,0:04:25.33,0:04:27.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,," Ay ıxıxının altında...Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.71,0:04:31.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne romantik.Dialogue: 50,0:04:57.40,0:04:58.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...tutkularıyla...Dialogue: 50,0:04:59.15,0:05:01.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,küle dönecekler! "Dialogue: 50,0:05:31.39,0:05:32.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kin-sama!Dialogue: 50,0:05:32.52,0:05:33.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kin-san!Dialogue: 50,0:05:43.32,0:05:46.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Efendimizin öcü için!Dialogue: 50,0:05:52.87,0:05:55.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Geber!Dialogue: 50,0:05:55.04,0:05:57.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eceline mi susadın?Dialogue: 50,0:05:57.92,0:06:00.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kin-san!Dialogue: 50,0:06:25.28,0:06:26.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?Dialogue: 50,0:06:39.21,0:06:43.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Siz Oden'in tırnaxı olamazsınız.Dialogue: 50,0:06:43.42,0:06:47.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden'in kanatları altında büyük samuraylar gibi geçiniyordunuz.Dialogue: 50,0:06:47.55,0:06:52.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden'in vefatından sonra bile samuraycılık oynayanların elinden...Dialogue: 50,0:06:52.43,0:06:54.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ne gelebilir ki?Dialogue: 50,0:06:54.06,0:06:59.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Samuraycılık mı oynuyoruz, vücudunda test edelim o hâlde!Dialogue: 50,0:07:00.65,0:07:03.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gelin de alın baxını!Dialogue: 50,0:07:03.53,0:07:04.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hücum!Dialogue: 50,0:07:23.21,0:07:24.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kızıl Kedi Dansı!Dialogue: 50,0:07:25.05,0:07:27.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kappa Stili:Dialogue: 50,0:07:31.31,0:07:32.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Deniz Nehri!Dialogue: 50,0:07:34.77,0:07:35.64,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne?Dialogue: 50,0:07:42.36,0:07:44.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Köpek Azabı!Dialogue: 50,0:07:47.57,0:07:49.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kar Tırpanı Yaxıxı!Dialogue: 50,0:07:54.50,0:07:56.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Keskin !emberler!Dialogue: 50,0:08:09.26,0:08:10.93,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Nasıl ix bu?Dialogue: 50,0:08:10.93,0:08:14.77,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Oden'in stilini kullanmadıkları hâlde...Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.77,0:08:16.85,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,nasıl beni kesebiliyorlar?Dialogue: 50,0:08:17.48,0:08:19.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido!Dialogue: 50,0:08:24.82,0:08:26.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gel hadi!Dialogue: 50,0:08:27.07,0:08:29.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gel hadi dedim!Dialogue: 50,0:08:33.45,0:08:36.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ninpo: Parxömen Teknixi!Dialogue: 50,0:08:46.09,0:08:49.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Parxömenlerim her xeyi sarmalayabilir.Dialogue: 50,0:09:04.32,0:09:06.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şimdi de iade ediyorum.Dialogue: 50,0:09:06.07,0:09:06.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sıcak Nefes...Dialogue: 50,0:09:07.28,0:09:08.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yenilen!Dialogue: 50,0:09:46.40,0:09:49.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beni öldürebilecexinizi mi sandınız?Dialogue: 50,0:09:50.07,0:09:54.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sizler, efendinizin gölgesini kovalayan...Dialogue: 50,0:09:54.37,0:09:57.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,bir avuç ezik hizmetkârsınız!Dialogue: 50,0:09:58.58,0:10:00.04,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet.Dialogue: 50,0:10:00.37,0:10:02.25,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Eziktik.Dialogue: 50,0:10:02.25,0:10:05.54,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Size Oden İki Kılıç Stili'ni gösterecexim!Dialogue: 50,0:10:05.54,0:10:07.55,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,İyi böyle.Dialogue: 50,0:10:07.55,0:10:10.63,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Hepimizin kendi stili var.Dialogue: 50,0:10:10.63,0:10:14.18,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Neden be? Oden İki Kılıç Stili bu!Dialogue: 50,0:10:14.18,0:10:16.93,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Neden miras almak istemiyorsunuz?Dialogue: 50,0:10:16.93,0:10:18.93,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Elbette çok istiyorduk.Dialogue: 50,0:10:19.39,0:10:21.89,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Herkes gözde öxrenci olmaya takmıx durumdaydı.Dialogue: 50,0:10:22.69,0:10:26.44,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Gözde öxrenci olmak için savaxa bile tutuxtuk.Dialogue: 50,0:10:26.44,0:10:30.53,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Hepimiz onu çok sevdiximizden birbirimizi öldürmeye bile niyetlendik.Dialogue: 50,0:11:05.44,0:11:06.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Oden...  Oden...Dialogue: 50,0:11:10.69,0:11:12.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, ...İki Kılıç Stili!  ...İki Kılıç Stili!Dialogue: 50,0:11:12.94,0:11:15.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,N'apıyorsunuz?Dialogue: 50,0:11:17.24,0:11:20.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Box hareketler!Dialogue: 50,0:11:21.54,0:11:23.37,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,İyi dinleyin!Dialogue: 50,0:11:23.37,0:11:24.96,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Ryuo...Dialogue: 50,0:11:28.50,0:11:29.84,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Dinlesenize be!Dialogue: 50,0:11:32.13,0:11:37.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano'yu bugün kurtarabilmek adına kılıç becerilerimizi ilerlettik!Dialogue: 50,0:11:47.52,0:11:49.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alev Yaran!Dialogue: 50,0:12:09.75,0:12:14.80,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Samuraylarımı hafife alayım deme! Dialogue: 50,0:12:15.34,0:12:20.68,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Senin bu yixitçe vedan asırlar boyu unutulmayacak.Dialogue: 50,0:12:21.18,0:12:24.22,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Unutulmam umurumda dexil!Dialogue: 50,0:12:24.22,0:12:28.69,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Ruhum yaxamaya devam edecek!Dialogue: 50,0:12:29.23,0:12:31.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Oden İki Kılıç Stili:  Oden İki Kılıç Stili:Dialogue: 50,0:12:32.69,0:12:37.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, ...Cennet Totsuka!  ...Cennet Totsuka!Dialogue: 50,0:13:28.66,0:13:31.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şarkı söyleyin! Dans edin!Dialogue: 50,0:13:31.29,0:13:34.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vur patlasın çal oynasın, bugün Atex Festivali!Dialogue: 50,0:13:45.64,0:13:50.27,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano'nun refahı yüksek yegane yeri !içek Baxkenti'dir.Dialogue: 50,0:13:50.98,0:13:55.02,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Burada oturanlar bile tıpkı ülkenin geri kalanı gibi...Dialogue: 50,0:13:55.02,0:13:59.23,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,korkularını gülümsemeyle gizleyip hayatta kalmaya çalıxıyorlar.Dialogue: 50,0:14:00.19,0:14:06.28,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Bunun nedeni ise, Kozuki samuraylarının günün birinde ülkeyi kurtaracak olması.Dialogue: 50,0:14:07.66,0:14:10.79,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,Herkes bu efsaneye...Dialogue: 50,0:14:10.79,0:14:15.21,Narrator-207+,,0,0,0,,gönülden inanmakta çünkü.Dialogue: 50,0:14:21.51,0:14:22.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,!ok iyi be!Dialogue: 50,0:14:22.76,0:14:25.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bütün gün içebilirim!Dialogue: 50,0:14:26.14,0:14:29.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Atex Festivali ne güzel.Dialogue: 50,0:14:29.56,0:14:31.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Evet...Dialogue: 50,0:14:31.43,0:14:33.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beni eski güzel günlere götürüyor.Dialogue: 50,0:14:34.56,0:14:38.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kexke bugün hiç bitmese...Dialogue: 50,0:14:39.07,0:14:41.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ve böyle sürüp gitse...Dialogue: 50,0:14:47.87,0:14:49.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bayıldım.Dialogue: 50,0:14:50.04,0:14:52.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Böyle temiz bir su içebiliyoruz.Dialogue: 50,0:14:52.41,0:14:54.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne güzel bir gün!Dialogue: 50,0:14:55.08,0:14:57.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hava da temiz.Dialogue: 50,0:14:57.96,0:14:59.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bir güzel içimize çekelim.Dialogue: 50,0:15:01.09,0:15:05.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Festivalle beraber içki faslı da bitecek.Dialogue: 50,0:15:07.22,0:15:09.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yine koca bir yıl bekleyecexiz.Dialogue: 50,0:15:10.10,0:15:11.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Böyle ixe!Dialogue: 50,0:15:12.31,0:15:15.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kexke Orochi, Kaido'nun destexine sahip olmasaydı!Dialogue: 50,0:15:15.39,0:15:17.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bugün kimse öldürülmeyecek.Dialogue: 50,0:15:17.98,0:15:20.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şahane bir gün.Dialogue: 50,0:15:20.98,0:15:24.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Orochi yarın burada olacak gerçi.Dialogue: 50,0:15:29.87,0:15:35.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kozuki Hanesi savaxa girmixtir ximdi!Dialogue: 50,0:15:35.37,0:15:38.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hayali bile güzel.Dialogue: 50,0:15:38.58,0:15:40.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Devam etsene.Dialogue: 50,0:15:40.29,0:15:45.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Peki! Dört bir yandan Onigashima'ya adam yıxıp...Dialogue: 50,0:15:45.42,0:15:51.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Orochi'yle Kaido'yu sırayla kesmix ve ortalıxın anasını axlatıyorlar!Dialogue: 50,0:15:52.56,0:15:54.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Devam! Devam!Dialogue: 50,0:15:54.10,0:15:56.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bugün hayallerimizi paylaxma günü!Dialogue: 50,0:16:14.41,0:16:16.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,D-Donuyorum!Dialogue: 50,0:16:16.62,0:16:18.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yardım edin!Dialogue: 50,0:16:22.54,0:16:23.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vaziyet sakat.Dialogue: 50,0:16:23.55,0:16:25.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onlara yaklaxmayın!Dialogue: 50,0:16:25.30,0:16:26.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Geri çekilin!Dialogue: 50,0:16:27.42,0:16:30.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onlardan uzak durun!Dialogue: 50,0:16:36.14,0:16:38.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Samuraylar birbiriyle savaxıyor. N'oluyor?Dialogue: 50,0:16:40.94,0:16:43.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şu vebadan olsa gerek...Dialogue: 50,0:16:43.15,0:16:45.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dokunsan xeytana dönüxüyorsun.Dialogue: 50,0:16:45.82,0:16:47.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Korkutucu bir bulaxma hızı.Dialogue: 50,0:16:47.53,0:16:50.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Böyle bir virüsü nasıl yayar?Dialogue: 50,0:16:50.99,0:16:53.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şeytanın ta kendisi!Dialogue: 50,0:16:55.29,0:16:57.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dixer katlara giden yolları kapatın.Dialogue: 50,0:16:57.96,0:17:00.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu kat iflah olmaz artık.Dialogue: 50,0:17:09.22,0:17:12.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Baxyapıtım be.Dialogue: 50,0:17:13.14,0:17:14.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Veba mermileri:Dialogue: 50,0:17:14.76,0:17:16.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Buz Şeytanı!Dialogue: 50,0:17:21.81,0:17:23.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,!ekilin!Dialogue: 50,0:17:24.40,0:17:26.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni piç!Dialogue: 50,0:17:30.20,0:17:32.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,!ekilin demedim mi?Dialogue: 50,0:17:33.12,0:17:34.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bekle, Luffy.Dialogue: 50,0:17:34.62,0:17:35.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne yapıyorsun be?Dialogue: 50,0:17:36.33,0:17:39.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen Kaido'yla dövüxeceksin.Dialogue: 50,0:17:39.20,0:17:41.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Enerjini korumaya bak.Dialogue: 50,0:17:41.29,0:17:44.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hasır Şapka'nın kellesini uçurun!Dialogue: 50,0:17:44.21,0:17:46.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen karıxma, kıvrık kax!Dialogue: 50,0:17:48.76,0:17:49.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İndirelim xunu!Dialogue: 50,0:17:49.80,0:17:54.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Size ben tek yeterim.Dialogue: 50,0:17:59.73,0:18:03.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Parti Masası Tekme Servisi!Dialogue: 50,0:18:19.24,0:18:21.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İtin tohumu,Dialogue: 50,0:18:21.25,0:18:23.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,adamlarımı haxat edersin ha!Dialogue: 50,0:18:23.96,0:18:26.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Buradan geçix yok!Dialogue: 50,0:18:27.88,0:18:30.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hazırlayın kendinizi!Dialogue: 50,0:18:35.76,0:18:38.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Goril elinde mi çıkıyo'? !ok garip!Dialogue: 50,0:18:40.60,0:18:42.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,!ok biliyorsun.Dialogue: 50,0:18:42.73,0:18:46.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O zaman bir gorilin nereden çıkacaxını...Dialogue: 50,0:18:48.90,0:18:50.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,göstersene bana!Dialogue: 50,0:18:52.40,0:18:53.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ne bileyim lan ben?Dialogue: 50,0:18:56.53,0:18:59.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Goril Yumruxumun Yumruxu!Dialogue: 50,0:19:01.08,0:19:02.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vay be.Dialogue: 50,0:19:02.20,0:19:04.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Güçlüymüx.Dialogue: 50,0:19:04.08,0:19:06.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Goril Yumruxu süpermix!Dialogue: 50,0:19:12.05,0:19:14.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Su Atıxı!Dialogue: 50,0:19:23.68,0:19:26.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oo! Jinbe!Dialogue: 50,0:19:36.15,0:19:39.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni burada bir yerde bulabileceximi düxündüm.Dialogue: 50,0:19:39.16,0:19:41.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Haklı da çıktım.Dialogue: 50,0:19:41.74,0:19:42.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Briscola-san!Dialogue: 50,0:19:43.45,0:19:44.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İyi misiniz?Dialogue: 50,0:19:48.96,0:19:50.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of, ay, ay...Dialogue: 50,0:19:51.38,0:19:53.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, iyi misin?Dialogue: 50,0:19:53.30,0:19:54.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Topla kendini!Dialogue: 50,0:20:01.47,0:20:03.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lan ibix!Dialogue: 50,0:20:03.18,0:20:06.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Erkek adam arkadan saldırır mı?Dialogue: 50,0:20:06.77,0:20:09.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamam, bu sefer ben dövüxecexim!Dialogue: 50,0:20:09.52,0:20:14.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yavax! 50 kere dedim enerjini koru diye.Dialogue: 50,0:20:14.48,0:20:17.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu kadar adamı halletmen uzun sürer!Dialogue: 50,0:20:17.49,0:20:18.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kes!Dialogue: 50,0:20:18.45,0:20:21.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,10 saniyede icaplarına bakarım.Dialogue: 50,0:20:21.20,0:20:22.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamam mı?Dialogue: 50,0:20:22.20,0:20:25.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamam dexil! Ben yardım edersem üç saniye sürer.Dialogue: 50,0:20:26.33,0:20:28.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beni siklemiyorlar!Dialogue: 50,0:20:28.83,0:20:30.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hazır olun!Dialogue: 50,0:20:31.42,0:20:35.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Goril Yumruxumun Yumruxu!Dialogue: 50,0:20:37.01,0:20:41.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Balıkadam Karatesi: Köpek Balıxı Tuxla Yumruxu!Dialogue: 50,0:20:59.78,0:21:02.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Briscola-san!Dialogue: 50,0:21:06.75,0:21:08.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vay, helal.Dialogue: 50,0:21:08.37,0:21:10.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Süpersin Jinbe!Dialogue: 50,0:21:10.29,0:21:11.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 50,0:21:11.79,0:21:14.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sana çatıya kadar exlik edecexim.Dialogue: 50,0:21:14.17,0:21:17.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen enerjini koru.Dialogue: 50,0:21:17.67,0:21:20.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Niye idareyi sen alıyorsun?Dialogue: 50,0:21:20.30,0:21:22.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy'yi buraya kadar getiren benim.Dialogue: 50,0:21:24.01,0:21:26.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Haklısın. Kusuruma bakma.Dialogue: 50,0:21:26.14,0:21:30.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy, ximdiye müttefikimiz olan samuraylar varmıxtır.Dialogue: 50,0:21:30.23,0:21:32.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onlarla buluxalım!Dialogue: 50,0:21:32.31,0:21:34.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tamam, olur!Dialogue: 50,0:21:34.11,0:21:36.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Durumu okuması da iyi adamın!Dialogue: 50,0:21:36.44,0:21:39.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Briscola-san'ı yere yıxdılar!Dialogue: 50,0:21:39.28,0:21:40.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Haklayın xunları!Dialogue: 50,0:21:46.28,0:21:49.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy dövüx fırsatını kaçırmaz, ona göre.Dialogue: 50,0:21:49.29,0:21:50.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Göz kulak olalım.Dialogue: 50,0:22:06.43,0:22:07.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dursana be!Dialogue: 50,0:22:10.68,0:22:12.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Durum ne, Bao Huang?Dialogue: 50,0:22:12.94,0:22:18.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yamato'yla Momonosuke, Sax Beyin Kulesi'nden çıkıxa doxru ilerliyor.Dialogue: 50,0:22:18.86,0:22:19.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeterli.Dialogue: 50,0:22:22.03,0:22:23.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben King.Dialogue: 50,0:22:23.66,0:22:27.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ziyafete sızan dingiller kimmix öxrendim.Dialogue: 50,0:22:28.08,0:22:30.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Düxmanın 5.400 adamı var.Dialogue: 50,0:22:31.41,0:22:36.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,!oxu samuray ve Oden'in hizmetkârlarının emrindeler.Dialogue: 50,0:22:37.21,0:22:38.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,zetle...Dialogue: 50,0:22:41.63,0:22:44.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kozuki Hanesi tekrar güç kazanmak için...Dialogue: 50,0:22:44.59,0:22:47.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,milleti ayaklandı.Dialogue: 50,0:22:49.72,0:22:56.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Niyetleri Oden'in oxlu Kozuki Momonosuke'yi Wano xogunu yapmak.Dialogue: 50,0:22:56.61,0:23:00.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boxta olan tüm Yetenekliler ve...Dialogue: 50,0:23:00.11,0:23:02.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tobi Roppo üyelerine emrimdir:Dialogue: 50,0:23:03.90,0:23:09.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Şu an Sax Beyin Kulesi'nden kaçmaya çalıxan Kozuki Momonosuke'yi öldürün...Dialogue: 50,0:23:09.08,0:23:11.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,ve kellesini önüme atın!Dialogue: 50,0:23:11.24,0:23:14.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bu hareket, samurayların mücadele azmine gem vurur.Dialogue: 50,0:23:17.08,0:23:23.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Korsanlar baxka bir mesele tabii.Dialogue: 50,0:23:33.73,0:23:37.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onu sax yakalamakla mükellef dexiliz...Dialogue: 50,0:23:37.02,0:23:38.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Böylesi daha kolay.Dialogue: 50,0:23:44.40,0:23:45.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Atex!Dialogue: 50,0:24:04.51,0:24:06.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cesedini getirin!Dialogue: 50,0:24:06.55,0:24:07.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Baxüstüne!  Baxüstüne!Dialogue: 50,0:24:10.05,0:24:11.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,İxte burada.Dialogue: 50,0:24:11.85,0:24:13.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Heh, bu ne lan?Dialogue: 50,0:24:13.97,0:24:14.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fıçı mı?Dialogue: 50,0:24:26.49,0:24:31.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Böyle bir silahla, biz zırhlı birlixin savunmasını yıkamazsın!Dialogue: 50,0:24:38.92,0:24:40.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shinobu!Dialogue: 50,0:24:40.21,0:24:41.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aman!Dialogue: 50,0:24:41.21,0:24:42.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Saklanın siz!Dialogue: 50,0:24:44.88,0:24:46.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Olmadı be.Dialogue: 50,0:24:46.84,0:24:50.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nerede vücudu saxlam olan adam varsa benim ekipte.Dialogue: 50,0:24:51.22,0:24:53.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaçacak yeriniz kalmadı!Dialogue: 50,0:24:54.85,0:24:56.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Velede nixan alın!Dialogue: 50,0:25:03.40,0:25:05.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-sama!Dialogue: 50,0:25:13.95,0:25:16.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Siz... kaçın!Dialogue: 50,0:25:17.62,0:25:18.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shinobu...Dialogue: 50,0:25:20.83,0:25:23.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seni de o veletle...Dialogue: 50,0:25:23.13,0:25:24.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,öteki tarafa yollayacaxım!Dialogue: 50,0:25:25.84,0:25:27.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sen ona kalkan bile olamazsın!Dialogue: 50,0:25:30.80,0:25:31.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shinobu!Dialogue: 50,0:25:35.06,0:25:36.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ka...Dialogue: 50,0:25:39.85,0:25:42.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaçın, Momonosuke-sama!Dialogue: 50,0:25:43.31,0:25:44.86,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaçayım mı?Dialogue: 50,0:25:44.86,0:25:48.78,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Şogunlar böyle mi yapar?Dialogue: 50,0:25:54.66,0:25:56.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shinobu! Shinobu!Dialogue: 50,0:25:57.99,0:25:59.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Elimdesin!Dialogue: 50,0:26:04.25,0:26:05.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,N'olur yapma!Dialogue: 50,0:26:07.96,0:26:11.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,N'olur!Dialogue: 50,0:26:41.16,0:26:43.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bak sen...Dialogue: 50,0:26:43.16,0:26:45.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Karıxmak mı istiyorsunuz...Dialogue: 50,0:26:45.13,0:26:46.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Genç Efendi Yamato.Dialogue: 50,0:26:48.55,0:26:49.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Karıxmayacaxım.Dialogue: 50,0:26:50.76,0:26:54.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kozuki adına savaxacaxım.Dialogue: 50,0:27:03.43,0:27:06.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ben, Oden'im çünkü!Dialogue: 50,0:27:12.19,0:27:14.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boxazını kesin!Dialogue: 50,0:27:14.15,0:27:17.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kellesini alana kadar bu ix bitmix sayılmaz!Dialogue: 50,0:27:17.16,0:27:18.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Doxru diyorsun!Dialogue: 50,0:27:18.41,0:27:21.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido'nun ixini bitirin!Dialogue: 50,0:27:35.30,0:27:41.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gösterdixiniz azimde Kozuki Oden'in gölgesini gördüm.Dialogue: 50,0:27:42.18,0:27:45.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,lüp gideydim kexke.Dialogue: 50,0:27:47.81,0:27:50.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yaram her sızladıxında...Dialogue: 50,0:27:50.02,0:27:54.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,o gün aklıma geliyor.Dialogue: 50,0:27:56.07,0:27:57.16,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Yardım et!Dialogue: 50,0:28:00.45,0:28:01.45,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Baba!Dialogue: 50,0:28:01.45,0:28:04.25,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Baba, kurtar beni!Dialogue: 50,0:28:15.38,0:28:16.76,Flashbacks-207+,,0,0,0,,Yanıldın!Dialogue: 50,0:28:23.89,0:28:28.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah bi' karıxmasalardı...Dialogue: 50,0:28:29.90,0:28:34.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ama siz Oden'in kalibresinde dexilsiniz.Dialogue: 50,0:28:41.70,0:28:47.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,yle deli kuvvetli bir samuray bir daha gelmez.Dialogue: 50,0:28:48.29,0:28:50.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yetersiz!Dialogue: 50,0:28:50.33,0:28:56.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Siz o gün aldıxım yarayı bile tekrar açamazsınız!Dialogue: 50,0:28:59.43,0:29:02.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sizin boyunuzu axar.Dialogue: 50,0:29:19.03,0:29:20.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Görünmez kesixler mi?!Dialogue: 50,0:29:40.93,0:29:42.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,, Kiku!  Kiku!Dialogue: 2,0:01:31.90,0:01:38.29,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,KalıntılarDialogue: 1,0:01:31.90,0:01:38.29,Title-207+,,0,0,0,,KalıntılarDialogue: 0,0:03:36.78,0:03:39.70,Captions-207+,Sign,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.78,0:03:39.70,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,m 1636.2 590 l 1621.67 589 1560.27 589.62 1553.4 588.27 1545.13 588.33 1531.18 562.91 1515.5 544.44 1501.6 532.93 1487.3 523.4 1470.5 517.3 1469.7 507.34 1470.71 499.64 1469.04 419.97 1469.42 255.03 1468.49 223.18 1469.73 216.43 1467.92 176.3 1468.54 155.03 1484.92 142.92 1499.46 130.53 1512.02 117.